# build artifacts
build/
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# engine (phases 3+) — Unreal
unreal/DerivedDataCache/
unreal/Intermediate/
unreal/Binaries/
unreal/Saved/
unreal/.vs/
*.uasset.tmp

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The staged canon (unreal/Content/Sim/canon/, written by
# tools/stage_canon_for_ue.py) is TRACKED on purpose so a pull plays with no
# extra step; `stage_canon_for_ue.py --check` catches drift from db/canon.

# generated art binaries (tools/art/*.py) — regenerate with the commands in
# tools/art/README.md; only art/review/ (contact sheet) and art/assets.csv
# are tracked.
art/generated/

# fetched CC0 character models (tools/art/fetch_characters.py) — ~19 MB of
# glTF per machine, regenerated by the fetcher; never tracked.
art/source/characters/

# raw downloads from tools/art/sources.py (art/sources.csv) — re-fetchable from
# the manifest (licence, url, date and a tree sha256 live in art/assets.csv).
art/source/ph_*/
art/source/acg_*/
art/source/kenney_*/
art/source/kaykit_*/

# generated per machine — never tracked
kernel/build*/
kernel/Testing/
unreal/Plugins/*/Binaries/
unreal/Plugins/*/Intermediate/
.claude/

# local execution ledgers (docs/superpowers/plans/STAGE-V-ROADMAP.md: copied into the plan's Status when a batch is done)
.superpowers/
